repository-code: "https://github.com/To-marigi/universe-theory-lab"
abstract: >-
  Final-Theory Bench compiles finite strong-operator quantum
  sequential-growth relations and verifies exact symbolic claims with
  hash-bound SageMath and Singular certificates. Version 0.3.7 proves
  Q1-through-Q4 commutativity for nonsingular solutions of the literal
  frozen n<=4, d=2 system on its recorded denominator-open locus by a
  Q5-free 21-chart calculation, while keeping the unrestricted theory
  explicitly open.
keywords:
  - causal sets
  - quantum sequential growth
  - computer-assisted proof
  - exact symbolic computation
  - Groebner bases
